## 🚀 How to Use

1. Download the Excel file from the repository
2. Open the file in Microsoft Excel (Desktop version recommended)
3. Use slicers to filter by month or day to explore the data interactively

---

## 💬 Conclusion

This project demonstrates how even simple tools like Excel can deliver **powerful data analytics solutions**.
By combining visuals with interactivity, businesses can make smarter decisions and uncover meaningful trends from everyday data.

